{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stardust aces is a six-axis space dog-fighting game with arcadey weapons and a semi-realistic flight model.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer/Coop Campaign (WIP)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP Mutliplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR Support</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the final frontier as &quot;Blackbeard&quot;, a newly hired privateer for a shipping company.\u00a0 Fly suicide missions, get underpaid, do something about it!\u00a0 Usher in the golden age of Space-Piracy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Schedule</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm looking at at least another year of development.\u00a0 Playable public playtest available now!\u00a0 Follow along with dev-streams on Tuesdays and Wednesdays!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443580?t=1753752585","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443580?t=1753752585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443580/591f1c6fcdc35b04727e62a17791e65d0a044408/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753752585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443580/591f1c6fcdc35b04727e62a17791e65d0a044408/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753752585","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The main campaign features swearing and depictions of combat."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stardust aces is a six-axis space dog-fighting game with arcadey weapons and a semi-realistic flight model.</p